<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="MK">
<l>ataṉāl, kuṇakaṭal koṇṭu kuṭakaṭaṉ muṟṟi</l>
<l>yiravu mellaiyum viḷiviṭa ṉaṟiyā</l>
<l>tavalu micaiyu nīrttiraḷ pīṇṭik</l>
<l>kavalaiyaṅ kuḻumpi ṉaruvi yolippak</l>
<l>kaḻaivaḷar cāraṟ kaḷiṟṟiṉa naṭuṅka</l>
<l>varaimuta liraṅku mēṟoṭu vāṉñemirntu</l>
<l>citaraṟ perumpeyal ciṟattaliṟ ṟāṅkātu</l>
<l>kuṇakaṭaṟ kivartaruṅ kurūuppuṉa lunti</l>
<l>nivantuce ṉīttaṅ kuḷaṅkoḷac cāṟṟik</l>
<l>kaḷiṟumāykkuṅ katirkkaḻaṉi</l>
<l>yoḷiṟilañci yaṭainivanta</l>
<l>muṭṭāḷa cuṭarttāmarai</l>
<l>kaṭkamaḻu naṟuneytal</l>
<l>vaḷḷita ḻaviḻnīla</l>
<l>mellilai yariyāmpaloṭu</l>
<l>vaṇṭiṟai koṇṭa kamaḻpūm poykaik</l>
<l>kampuṭ cēva liṉṟuyi liriya</l>
<l>vaḷḷai nīkki vayamīṉ mukantu</l>
<l>koḷḷai cāṟṟiya koṭumuṭi valaiñar</l>
<l>vēḻap paḻaṉattu nūḻi lāṭṭuk</l>
<l>karumpi ṉentiraṅ kaṭpi ṉōtai</l>
<l>yaḷḷaṟ ṟaṅkiya pakaṭuṟu viḻumaṅ</l>
<l>kaḷḷār kaḷamar peyarkku mārppē</l>
<l>yolinta pakaṉṟai viḷainta kaḻaṉi</l>
<l>vaṉkai viṉaiña raripaṟai yiṉkuraṟ</l>
<l>ṟaḷimaḻai poḻiyun taṇparaṅ kuṉṟiṟ</l>
<l>kalikoḷ cummai yoliko ḷāyan</l>
<l>tatainta kōtai tāroṭu poliyap</l>
<l>puṇarntuṭa ṉāṭu micaiyē yaṉaittu</l>
<l>makaliru vāṉat timiḻntiṉi ticaippak</l>
<l>kurukunarala maṉaimarattāṉ</l>
<l>mīṉcīvum pāṇcēriyoṭu</l>
<l>marutañ cāṉṟa taṇpaṇai cuṟṟi yorucārc</l>
<l>ciṟutiṉai koyyak kavvai kaṟuppak</l>
<l>karuṅkāl varaki ṉiruṅkural pulara</l>
<l>vāḻnta kuḻumpiṟ ṟirumaṇi kiḷara</l>
<l>veḻunta kaṭaṟṟi ṉaṉpoṉ koḻippap</l>
<l>peruṅkaviṉ peṟṟa ciṟutalai nauvi</l>
<l>maṭakkaṭ piṇaiyoṭu maṟukuvaṉa vukaḷac</l>
<l>cuṭarppūṅ koṉṟai tāaya nīḻaṟ</l>
<l>pāa yaṉṉa pāṟai yaṇintu</l>
<l>nīlat taṉṉa paimpayir micaitoṟum</l>
<l>veḷḷi yaṉṉa voḷvī yutirntu</l>
<l>curimukiḻ mucuṇṭaiyoṭu mullai tāay</l>
<l>maṇimaru ṇeyta luṟaḻak kāmar</l>
<l>tuṇinīr mellavaṟ ṟoyyiloṭu malara</l>
<l>vallōṉ ṟaiiya veṟikkaḷaṅ kaṭuppa</l>
<l>mullai cāṉṟa puṟavaṇin torucār</l>
      </lg>
